if DayAndNightManager.initial_day == 4:
	Man! I could really use a hot cup of coffee right now.
	- I have a coffee for you. | [if {has_coffee} == true] [else="disable"]
		do GameManager._dialogue_remove_item("Coffee")
		Oh, thank you! Now I can cram even futher and beyond!
		set {has_coffee} = false
		- What were you talking about with Liz earlier?
			She's complaining about her computer. Maybe you should go ask her.
	- Same
else:
	Hey, if you have seen a keycard laying around, please tell me.
	- Why?
		Al would be very mad if he finds out I lost mine.
